,"voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"m","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Im Herbst 1989 öffnete die DDR überraschend ihre Grenzen Diese Grenzöffnung löste eine Welle der Freude aus In einem Interview sagt eine Zeitzeugin heute „Ich habe diesen Tag nie vergessen Kurz darauf bildete sich eine neue Koalition im Bundestag Die Wiedervereinigung folgte weniger als ein Jahr später Rückblickend hat kaum jemand mit diesem Tempo gerechnet doch die Bilder von damals blieben unvergessen","authoredText":"Im Herbst 1989 öffnete die DDR überraschend ihre Grenzen. Diese Grenzöffnung löste eine Welle der Freude aus. In einem Interview sagt eine Zeitzeugin heute: „Ich habe diesen Tag nie vergessen.\" Kurz darauf bildete sich eine neue Koalition im Bundestag. Die Wiedervereinigung folgte weniger als ein Jahr später. Rückblickend hat kaum jemand mit diesem Tempo gerechnet, doch die Bilder von damals blieben unvergessen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Rückblick: Der Weg zur Wiedervereinigung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, meine Oma hat mir erzählt, wie sie die Maueröffnung erlebt hat.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Wirklich?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Was war das für ein Gefühl für sie?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Sie sagte, es war einfach unbeschreiblich — alle standen auf der Straße und weinten.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":5,"text":"Das hat sicher Eindruck gemacht.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":6,"text":"Hat sie dir auch erzählt, wie es danach weiterging?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":7,"text":"Ja, sie hat noch lange erzählt.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L005","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":8,"text":"Ich zeige dir nächstes Mal ihre Fotos.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L005","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, meine Oma hat mir erzählt, wie sie die Maueröffnung erlebt hat.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wirklich? Was war das für ein Gefühl für sie?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Sie sagte, es war einfach unbeschreiblich — alle standen auf der Straße und weinten.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Das hat sicher Eindruck gemacht. Hat sie dir auch erzählt, wie es danach weiterging?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L004","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":5,"text":"Ja, sie hat noch lange erzählt. Ich zeige dir nächstes Mal ihre Fotos.","speaker":"Ines","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_027_L005","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Sie hat mir erzählt, wie sie es erlebt hat. Sie sagte, es war unbeschreiblich.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Ein Freund fragt, was deine Oma über die Maueröffnung erzählt hat.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Wir sind sofort nach Berlin gefahren und haben Verwandte besucht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Er fragt, wie es in der Familie danach weiterging.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Die Bedingungen waren schwer, und viele hatten Angst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt nach den Lebensbedingungen damals.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Im Referat nehme ich das Präteritum: Deutschland wurde geteilt, die Mauer fiel 1989.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Ein Lernpartner fragt, wie du im Referat erzählen willst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Meine Großeltern haben viel verloren. Es war eine harte Zeit. — Und meine Familie ist nie ausgereist.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-27-perfekt-vs-praeteritum","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr sprecht über Familiengeschichten.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":52,"vword-voice-M":52,"vword-listen":52,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Bewachungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":25,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Entscheidungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Lebensbedingungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Schutzmaßnahmen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Voraussetzungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Wissenschaftssprachen","from":"vocab-plural